Agent SkillOps is derived from Self-Improving Agent Skills in
Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps:
https://github.com/Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps/tree/main/agent_skills/self-improving-agent-skills

The upstream project is distributed under Apache License 2.0.
SkillOps changes include persistent evaluation suites, separate judging,
regression and safety gates, version releases, task control, and learning notes.
RAG is not implemented in this version.
